[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13021.429, "timestamp": "03:37:01", "text": "和 YouTube 聊天之類的東西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13033.59, "timestamp": "03:37:13", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13035.67, "timestamp": "03:37:15", "text": "呃，稍等一下。這是無效的磁帶還是令牌？嗯？  我的意思是，我已經很久沒碰過這些東西了，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13036.59, "timestamp": "03:37:16", "text": "我忘了哪個是哪個……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13039.75, "timestamp": "03:37:19", "text": "呃……呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13043.429, "timestamp": "03:37:23", "text": "等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13045.99, "timestamp": "03:37:25", "text": "我需要打開"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13048.71, "timestamp": "03:37:28", "text": "YouTube。聊天指令，我一直都在用，效果很好。聊天指令。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13051.67, "timestamp": "03:37:31", "text": "這傢伙，我沒跟他重合。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13054.389, "timestamp": "03:37:34", "text": "這是桑多·蘭迪的風格。啊，對，就是那個。我沒碰過它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13060.15, "timestamp": "03:37:40", "text": "好的。呃，我的……我的……是這個嗎？  不，這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13063.83, "timestamp": "03:37:43", "text": "頂帽子是假的。哦，沒關係。沒關係。沒關係。"}]